QUALITY PLAYBACK — YEU CAU CHOT
- Trong giao dien Play cua muc YouTube phai co menu Quality theo giao dien Ivy hien tai.
- Quality mac dinh: Auto.
- HLS Master/DASH Manifest: doc cac variant bitrate/resolution thuc su ton tai.
- Auto de player native adaptive bitrate tu chon theo bandwidth, buffer va kha nang thiet bi.
- Mang tot -> tang quality; mang yeu -> ha quality de tranh rebuffer.
- Chuyen quality trong cung phien phat, khong restart player, khong seek, khong nhay playback position.
- Khoi dong nhanh: play nhanh, do bandwidth, sau do nang quality; khong cho 4K/2K truoc khi phat.
- Manual quality: Auto + chi hien cac resolution co that, vi du 2160p/1440p/1080p/720p.
- Chon 1080p phai tat adaptive switching va giu 1080p neu variant con kha dung.
- Tuyet doi tranh doi URL -> tao player moi -> seek lap lai.
- Android/Android TV: uu tien Media3/ExoPlayer adaptive bitrate.
- iOS: uu tien AVPlayer/AVFoundation adaptive bitrate.
- Log yeu cau: AUTO_QUALITY_ENABLED, BANDWIDTH_ESTIMATE, QUALITY_CHANGED, MANUAL_QUALITY_SELECTED.
- Muc tieu: Direct Play nhanh nhu VLC mo stream + Auto Quality on dinh + khong nhay thoi gian phat.

